<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>300 Photos With Strangers</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6a11cb,#2575fc);color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:100vh}
.card{max-width:420px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);padding:28px;border-radius:22px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
h1{margin:8px 0;font-size:2.2rem} .sub{opacity:.9}
.bar{background:#ffffff44;border-radius:999px;height:18px;overflow:hidden;margin:18px 0}
.fill{width:11.7%;height:100%;background:#ffd54f;animation:grow 2s}
@keyframes grow{from{width:0}to{width:35%}}
button{border:none;background:#ffd54f;color:#222;padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
#msg{display:none;margin-top:20px}
.small{font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9}
</style></head>
<body><div class="card">
<div style="font-size:56px">📸</div>
<h1>300 Photos<br>With Strangers</h1>
<p class="sub"><b>Be the next one!</b></p>
<div class="bar"><div class="fill"></div></div>
<p><b>Current Progress</b><br><span style="font-size:1.4rem">35 / 300</span></p>
<p>Hi! 👋<br>My goal is to take <b>300 photos with 300 different people</b> during Sziget Festival.</p>
<p>No catch. No promotion.<br>Just a fun memory we'll share.</p>
<button onclick="join()">YES, I'M IN!! ❤️</button>
<div id="msg">
<h2>Awesome! 🎉</h2>
<p>Come say hi if you spot me and let's take a photo together! 📸</p>
<p class="small">Thank you for being part of my story.</p>
</div>
</div>
<script>
function join(){document.getElementById('msg').style.display='block';window.scrollTo({top:document.body.scrollHeight,behavior:'smooth'});}
</script></body></html>
